 "remarks": "Rarely Available, Top-Floor, Corner Unit With LOFT. Soaring 13-foot high ceilings, gleaming hardwood floors and tons of natural light pouring in through oversized windows. Spacious Open-Concept living/dining/kitchen floor plan, ideal for entertaining and everyday living includes handy home office alcove. Remarkable 289 sq.ft. loft adds incredible functionality for a guest bed or massive storage space. Cook's kitchen features gas range, granite countertops, ample cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, pantry closet and convenient in-unit laundry. Sumptuous bedroom with dramatic ceiling height, extra-tall windows and a full wall of closets. Bright, updated bathroom with large lighted mirror/medicine cabinet. Entry area with room for bench/shoe storage. Central A/C and Energy-Efficient Gas Heat. Safe, secure, pet-friendly, well-maintained, 12-unit elevator building with gated, indoor assigned garage parking space plus additional guest parking. Lower level full laundry room. Located on a quiet, charming street in the heart of vibrant, bustling South Norwalk, mere steps to SoNo's popular restaurants and bars, AMC movie theater, Metro North train station, SoNo Collection Mall, Maritime Aquarium, Oyster Shell Park, Art Galleries and the Harbor. Not only an impressive, welcoming home, but also an invitation to Fairfield County's coveted coastal lifestyle. It's easy to fall in love with this sunny home and imagine just how dreamy life can be living here!",
